== Description ==

'''Sulfur''' is a mineable rock in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 19 downstream recipes at the [[Biochemical Workbench]] and the [[Cutting Workbench]], including [[Sulfurized Quartz Brick]], [[Gunpowder]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

